{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n 私はドキドキ感を味わうのが大好きです。\n ハラハラは嫌いですがドキドキは好きです。\n \n 一番好きなドキドキは、\n ランダムで中身が見えない系のやつを\n 開ける瞬間のドキドキです。\n \n だから、ランダムとかだと\n つい買ってしまいます。\n けやき坂のカードも狙っています。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XYW6WVFEF74TZFBSM9K22","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 12日に発売された\n 「blt glaph.」さんに載せていただいてます！\n ずーっと憧れてたblt graph.さん、、、\n 本当に嬉しいです💃💃\n \n とっても素敵に撮っていただいたので、\n 是非お手にとってみてください❣️\n \n \n \n \n \n ずっと載せれていなかった\n 先日の名古屋と横浜で\n いただいたお花たちです🌼\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XYX7F386RN0D85PC9RTET","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XYY8D9NGYKCNVHD8Q32CP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XYZANNM0X9R1H8HE3CWAZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ0CSB2FFEF7K1NJMY63Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n いつも素敵なお花を\n ありがとうございます。\n \n \n \n そして、横浜で来たお洋服たち〜〜\n \n \n 🐡1・2部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ1C7PEQTKXQNZQDQN5KQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ2F403QJX4Y1FJZ0V8VZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n テーマはアマガエル🐸\n 雨が降っていたのでね〜〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ3JKNJ1W04YC4D5WSGT0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n クェっって瞬間移動するときのポーズです。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ4MP5AX32DZ5AVSS922B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 2部ではめめちゃんのベレー帽被りました。\n \n ベレー帽を被ると、\n めめちゃんが褒めてくれるので\n 嬉しくてかりて被りました。\n \n \n \n 🐡4・5部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ5S0KPNTTP0VAQYE9BS3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n テーマはてるてる坊主です。\n 雨が降っていたので🍬\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ6VXV3Q0RGSZQEEQHM2H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ7XEXT05JRVVFKHEGT16","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n スカーフはアクセントになるし、\n とても使い回しが出来るので好きです👼\n \n \n \n \n \n ぱーん！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1XZ97KCCVZJCT5VFG32JXP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}